        "id": "Penjelasan",
        "en": "Explanation"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.quran-harakat-explanation",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Dalam latihan dasar, fathah memberi bunyi a, kasrah bunyi i, dan dammah bunyi u.",
        "en": "In basic practice, fathah gives an a sound, kasrah an i sound, and dammah a u sound."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.quran-harakat-example-heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": {
        "id": "Contoh dalam kehidupan",
        "en": "Life example"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.quran-harakat-example",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Huruf ب dapat dibaca ba, bi, atau bu sesuai tanda yang menyertainya.",
        "en": "The letter ب can be read ba, bi, or bu according to its mark."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.quran-harakat-action-heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": {
        "id": "Langkah tindakan",
        "en": "Action step"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.quran-harakat-action",
      "type": "steps",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "step.quran-harakat-action",
          "title": {
            "id": "Praktikkan",
            "en": "Put it into practice"
          },
          "body": {
            "id": "Baca rangkaian dua atau tiga huruf berharakat dengan perlahan tanpa menebak.",
            "en": "Read sequences of two or three marked letters slowly without guessing."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
